{
  "about": "The title bar's Sound panel on the dev app (his library), after its lower box left (SOUND.md §11b): the open, the i fold in and out (and two clicks 90 ms apart, which turn the motion round), the ⋯ actions row in and out, Remember each output Off and On, Sliders to Dots and back, the Equalizer Off and On, the close. In Press and in Glass (the heaviest to draw). Each shot sets its settings through the store and puts them back, so his Equalizer, its mode, Remember each output and his skin end as they were. Made by a script from one step list, so both skins run the same steps.",
  "desk_test": "features/SOUND.md §11b",
  "made": "2026-10-19",
  "pass": "Each probe's expect holds. In the console file: each [perf] frames line for sound and fold with dropped under 3 % and worst under 17 ms at the display's rate. In the strips: the panel grows from the button, the rows enter in order, a part that comes or goes (the i fold, the ⋯ row) grows or shrinks its own height so the rows under it glide and the panel's edge follows (no jump in one frame), and the close leaves nothing behind.",
  "run": "node scripts/shots.mjs --list docs/ops/checks/sound-panel-motion.json   (needs `npm run dev:app` running, its window on screen)",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "sound-panel-press",
      "covers": "features/SOUND.md",
      "kind": "clip",
      "source": "dev",
      "seconds": 16,
      "settings": {
        "skin": "press",
        "soundEq": true,
        "soundEqMode": "graphic",
        "soundEqPerOutput": true
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "eval": "(() => { if (!document.getElementById('sound-panel').hidden) document.getElementById('sound-btn').click(); })()"
        },
        {
          "wait": 600
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ shut: document.getElementById('sound-panel').hidden })",
          "expect": {
            "shut": true
          },
          "name": "rest"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-btn",
          "frames": 45,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        },
        {
          "probe": "(() => { const p = document.getElementById('sound-panel'); const rows = [...p.querySelectorAll('.sound__view > *')].filter((e) => e.offsetParent); return JSON.stringify({ open: !p.hidden, footer: p.querySelectorAll('.sound__footer').length + [...p.querySelectorAll('.sound__fold-btn')].filter((b) => b.offsetParent).length, last: rows.at(-1)?.querySelector('.sound__label')?.textContent ?? null, scrolls: p.scrollHeight > p.clientHeight + 1 }); })()",
          "expect": {
            "open": true,
            "footer": 0,
            "last": "Remember each output",
            "scrolls": false
          },
          "name": "open"
        },
        {
          "eval": "(() => { if (!document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info-body').hidden) document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info').click(); })()"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__info",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ shown: (() => { const e = document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info-body'); return !e.hidden && e.getBoundingClientRect().height > 0; })(), anims: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info-body').getAnimations().length })",
          "expect": {
            "shown": true,
            "anims": 0
          },
          "name": "i open"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__info",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ hidden: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info-body').hidden })",
          "expect": {
            "hidden": true
          },
          "name": "i shut"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__info"
        },
        {
          "wait": 90
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__info",
          "frames": 30,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ hidden: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info-body').hidden, expanded: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__info').getAttribute('aria-expanded') })",
          "expect": {
            "hidden": true,
            "expanded": "false"
          },
          "name": "i twice"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel [aria-label=\"Preset actions\"]",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ shown: (() => { const e = document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__actions'); return !e.hidden && e.getBoundingClientRect().height > 0; })(), anims: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__actions').getAnimations().length })",
          "expect": {
            "shown": true,
            "anims": 0
          },
          "name": "actions open"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel [aria-label=\"Preset actions\"]",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ hidden: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__actions').hidden })",
          "expect": {
            "hidden": true
          },
          "name": "actions shut"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__view > .sound__row:last-child .sound__pill",
          "frames": 20,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 400
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ perOut: window.__store.get('soundEqPerOutput'), text: document.querySelector('#sound-panel .sound__view > .sound__row:last-child .sound__pill').textContent })",
          "expect": {
            "perOut": false,
            "text": "Off"
          },
          "name": "per output off"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__view > .sound__row:last-child .sound__pill",
          "frames": 20,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 400
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ perOut: window.__store.get('soundEqPerOutput') })",
          "expect": {
            "perOut": true
          },
          "name": "per output on"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__presets .sound__pill",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ mode: window.__store.get('soundEqMode') })",
          "expect": {
            "mode": "parametric"
          },
          "name": "dots"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__presets .sound__pill",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__row--strong .sound__pill",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ eq: window.__store.get('soundEq') })",
          "expect": {
            "eq": false
          },
          "name": "eq off"
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-panel .sound__row--strong .sound__pill",
          "frames": 40,
          "region": "#sound-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 700
        },
        {
          "click": "#sound-btn",
          "frames": 40
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ shut: document.getElementById('sound-panel').hidden, eq: window.__store.get('soundEq'), mode: window.__store.get('soundEqMode'), perOut: window.__store.get('soundEqPerOutput') })",
          "expect": {
            "shut": true,
            "eq": true,
            "mode": "graphic",
            "perOut": true
          },
          "name": "closed"
        }
      ]
    },
